// sc4sap:program-to-spec — Image swap helper for cloned spec xlsx files.
//
// PURPOSE
//   Replace the program-agnostic mockup PNGs embedded in the spec workbook
//   with program-specific PNGs, and inject a horizontal Process Flow chart
//   into the (intentionally empty) sheet4 drawing slot.
//
// SLOTS
//   selection  → xl/media/image2.png  (Sheet 3, anchor C4,  ext from PNG IHDR)
//   alv        → xl/media/image1.png  (Sheet 3, anchor C19, ext from PNG IHDR)
//   processFlow→ xl/media/image3.png  (Sheet 4, anchor B19, ext from PNG IHDR)
//                ↑ slot is created on demand — drawing4.xml is empty in
//                  template_base.xlsx by design (each program has its own
//                  flow chart, so the template ships a blank container).
//
//   Why ext is ALWAYS taken from the swapped PNG, never the template
//   default: oneCellAnchor uses absolute EMU extents, so a PNG whose
//   aspect ratio differs from the template default would otherwise be
//   stretched (selection 3.21:1 slot rendering a 3.88:1 PNG produced
//   visibly squished text — fixed 2026-05-24).
//
// WHY A SEPARATE HELPER (not part of template-clone)
//   template_base.xlsx is the permanent reference. Cloning produces a fresh
//   xlsx with the two program-agnostic mockups intact and drawing4.xml
//   blank. Image swap is opt-in (trigger keywords only) so the default
//   program-to-spec path stays drift-free.
//
// API
//   swapImages({ xlsxPath, selectionPng?, alvPng?, processFlowPng? })
//     Each PNG input is Buffer | string (file path) | null.
//     Returns { xlsxPath, swapped: { selection, alv, processFlow }, bytes }.
//
// CLI (zero-dep)
//   node image-swap.mjs <xlsx> --selection <p> --alv <p> --process-flow <p>
//   node image-swap.mjs <xlsx> <selection.png> <alv.png> <process-flow.png>
//       (positional, use "-" to skip any slot)
//
// SAFETY
//   · PNG signature verified before any write; non-PNG input rejected.
//   · template_base.xlsx is never touched.
//   · drawing3.xml + its rels stay byte-for-byte (Sheet 3 anchors preserved).
//   · drawing4.xml is mutated ONLY when processFlowPng is supplied.

